subckt dut (VDD VSS)
C1 (net0 net1) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net1 net0) capacitor c=1p
L1 (net3 VSS) inductor l=1n
L2 (net1 net0) inductor l=1n
L3 (net0 net1) inductor l=1n
L4 (VDD net2) inductor l=1n
M1 (net1 net0 net3 VSS) sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=150n ng=1 m=1
M2 (net0 net1 net3 VSS) sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=150n ng=1 m=1
M3 (net0 net1 net2 VDD) sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=150n ng=1 m=1
M4 (net1 net0 net2 VDD) sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=150n ng=1 m=1
